WEBVTT

00:38:26.204 --> 00:38:31.038
the act of remembering your suffering
can become pleasure afterwards.

00:38:31.038 --> 00:38:34.413
And I wanted to know, like, how so?
How does that become pleasure?

00:38:34.579 --> 00:38:37.413
I'm such a believer. I call
it retrospective fun.

00:38:37.621 --> 00:38:40.663
OK, and this is the advice too.

00:38:40.663 --> 00:38:44.204
I'd give someone wanted to take a
long hike is you just have to

00:38:44.246 --> 00:38:45.704
or really any kind of journey.

00:38:46.038 --> 00:38:47.913
You just have to acknowledge that,

00:38:48.079 --> 00:38:54.329
that very often the best things we do are
painful and complicated and difficult

00:38:54.329 --> 00:38:58.454
and exhausting and require us to
be out of our comfort zone

00:38:58.829 --> 00:39:01.996
and to accept difficult things. Right.